---
import TitleLv2 from "../common/TitleLv2.astro";
---

<section class="works-problem">
  <div class="l-container">
    <div class="l-section">
      <TitleLv2 title="制作前の課題・要望"/>
      <div class="l-section-body">
        <ul class="works-problem-list c-list-green-line">
          <li class="works-problem-item c-list-green-line-item">サロンの強み・世界観や施術内容をわかりやすく伝えたい</li>
          <li class="works-problem-item c-list-green-line-item">地域検索で見つけてもらえる土台をつくりたい</li>
          <li class="works-problem-item c-list-green-line-item">予約や問い合わせにつながる導線を整えたい</li>
          <li class="works-problem-item c-list-green-line-item">小規模事業でも無理なく運用できる形にしたい</li>
        </ul>
      </div><!-- /.l-section-body -->
    </div><!-- /.l-section -->
  </div><!-- /.l-container -->
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '../../styles/breakpoints' as *;

</style>
